  "content": "\n\n<h1>Bundle 重量，還有更多！</h1>\n<p>是否曾希望那些每次只能放一個的物品能一起裝進 Bundle（束口袋）裡？現在可以了！本模組透過新增一個 <code>bundleweight:bundle_weight</code> 元件來控制佔用空間，從而將堆疊數量與 Bundle 重量分開！該元件包含 <code>numerator</code>（分子）與 <code>denominator</code>（分母）欄位，支援進階自訂！</p>\n<p>範例：<code>/give @s minecraft:diamond_sword[bundleweight:bundle_weight={numerator:1,denominator:3}]</code></p>\n<p>Boom！現在你擁有一把只佔用 Bundle 1/3 空間，但堆疊數量仍維持為 1 的鑽石劍。</p>\n<p>注意：本模組為程式庫（Library），本身不會直接修改 Bundle 重量。如需相關功能，請參見 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbundlefour\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bundle 等等，還有四個！</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/v/1134075?label=latest\" alt=\"CurseForge 版本\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/game-versions/bundleweight\" alt=\"Modrinth 遊戲版本\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/thomasglasser/Bundle-Weight-Theres-More\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"於 Github 取得\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbundleweight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"於 Modrinth 取得\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bundleweight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"於 Curseforge 取得\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbundleweight%252fversions%253fl%253dneoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/thomasglasser/thomasglasser/1f85027a20670b89b94462ddd345af897b47ac17/files/badges/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"支援 NeoForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbundleweight%252fversions%253fl%253dfabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"支援 Fabric\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbundleweight%252fversions%253fl%253dquilt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"支援 Quilt\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/thomasglasser/Bundle-Weight-Theres-More/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/documentation/ghpages_vector.svg\" alt=\"閱讀文件\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252fthomasglasser\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/donate/buymeacoffee-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"請我喝杯咖啡\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/tjf7CedM38\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcloudsmith.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/OSS hosting by-cloudsmith-blue?logo=cloudsmith&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"託管服務：Cloudsmith\"></a></p>\n<p>套件儲存庫託管服務由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcloudsmith.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloudsmith</a> 慷慨提供。\nCloudsmith 是唯一完全託管的雲端原生通用套件管理解決方案，讓您的組織能夠以絕對的信心建立、儲存並分享任何格式的套件至任何地方。</p>\n<h2>統計數據</h2>\n<h3>Github</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/thomasglasser/Bundle-Weight-Theres-More/total?color=blue\" alt=\"GitHub 所有版本下載次數\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/thomasglasser/Bundle-Weight-Theres-More\" alt=\"GitHub 儲存庫星數\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/thomasglasser/Bundle-Weight-Theres-More\" alt=\"GitHub 問題回報\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-pr/thomasglasser/Bundle-Weight-Theres-More\" alt=\"GitHub 合併請求\"></p>\n<h3>Modrinth</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/bundleweight\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\"></p>\n<h3>Curseforge</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1134075?color=orange\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\"></p>",
